@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #486777
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #EEF5FA
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #486777
skinparam packageBackgroundColor #F7FAFC
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF3DA
skinparam noteBorderColor #B59865
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 45
title Disaster recovery — restore, validate and controlled resumption
actor "Authorized operator" as Op
participant "Protected recovery source\n(not configured)" as Backup
participant "Isolated recovery candidate\n(not established)" as Candidate
participant "External providers / targets" as External
Op -> Op : define loss scenario, coverage, authority\nand usable-state / loss / timing criteria
alt no accessible consistent protected source (current evidence position)
 Op -> Op : record blocked recovery\nno demonstrated usable restore
else prerequisites later established and drill separately authorized
 Op -> Backup : select verified recovery point\nrecords + files + repositories + required configuration
 Backup --> Op : protected material + integrity / coverage evidence
 Op -> Candidate : restore isolated candidate; record actual results
 Op -> Candidate : validate relationships, actual submitted history\ncurrent grants, revoked rights and required secrets
 Op -> External : reconcile attributable pending effects/state\nonly through separately authorized checks
 External --> Op : available evidence or unresolved effects
 note over Candidate,External
 Do not replay mail, jobs or deployment effects automatically.
 Restoring local bytes does not restore provider/target state.
 end note
 alt integrity / current-access / usable-state criteria unmet or unknown
  Op -> Op : retain restricted candidate; record incomplete/failed scope
 else required checks pass with measured loss and elapsed time
  Op -> Op : record scoped recovery evidence\ncompare with separately agreed RPO/RTO when available
  Op -> Candidate : separately authorize controlled resumption\nonly for verified eligible scope
 end
end

legend bottom
Proposed recovery sequence derived from SQ-R subjects and DC-O37/38; no production restore authorized.
Backup source, isolated target and numeric recovery objectives remain unestablished.
endlegend
@enduml
